# Mac-side bridge set — the files that run on the MacBook.
#
# Every file listed here deploys TOGETHER via bridges/install-mac.sh, and
# bridges/verify-mac-install.sh checksums the deployed copies against this
# repo. A change to one file can never be installed without the others:
# that partial install is the incident this exists to prevent (task-va5wb:
# mac_preview.py shipped without its macos_state.py importer, the preview
# thread never started, and the forgiving import guard hid it).
#
# Columns: <filename> <role>. Role is either
#   job:<launchd-label>   the file a LaunchAgent executes directly, or
#   lib:<label>[,<label>] a sibling imported by that job's file(s).
# Shared libs name every job that imports them.
#
# Launchd coverage (see the plists next to this file):
#   macos-state-bridge  runs macos_state.py; mac_preview + mac_zoom ride
#                       INSIDE it (daemon thread / tap hooks) — no plist.
#   talon-apps-bridge   runs talon_apps.py (talon_windows rides inside).
#   firebot-chat-bridge runs firebot_chat.py.
#   beads-activity-bridge runs beads_activity.py (via its __main__ guard;
#                       beads_activity_cli is the argparse entry module).
#   obs-stream-bridge   runs obs_poll.py (new plist; was missing entirely).
#
# Panel-host only (deliberately NOT listed — never deployed to the Mac):
#   firebot-chat-bridge.service (systemd unit for lnx-server; retired —
#     the Mac LaunchAgent is the durable home, see AGENTS.md).
macos_state.py            job:com.displayd.macos-state-bridge
macos_state_format.py     lib:com.displayd.macos-state-bridge
mac_preview.py            lib:com.displayd.macos-state-bridge
mac_zoom.py               lib:com.displayd.macos-state-bridge
talon_channel.py          lib:com.displayd.macos-state-bridge,com.displayd.talon-apps-bridge
talon_apps.py             job:com.displayd.talon-apps-bridge
talon_windows.py          lib:com.displayd.talon-apps-bridge
firebot_chat.py           job:com.displayd.firebot-chat-bridge
firebot_wire.py           lib:com.displayd.firebot-chat-bridge
beads_activity.py         job:com.displayd.beads-activity-bridge
beads_activity_events.py  lib:com.displayd.beads-activity-bridge
beads_activity_cli.py     lib:com.displayd.beads-activity-bridge
obs_poll.py               job:com.displayd.obs-stream-bridge
obs_protocol.py           lib:com.displayd.obs-stream-bridge
obs_ws.py                 lib:com.displayd.obs-stream-bridge
obs_poll_cli.py           lib:com.displayd.obs-stream-bridge
